# data/ holds fetched copies of the registries, which are someone else's file
# and get re-fetched every build. The two exceptions are inputs, not output:
# a measurement nobody can reproduce without an API budget, and a survey read
# by hand off two dozen websites. The site links to both as its receipts.
data/*.json
!data/ecosystem.json
!data/directories.json
